{"id":"7dabbb234eb00a32","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-zfc-topo11-product-projection-continuous.md","title":"ZFC Topo11 Product Projection Continuous","display":"df-zfc-topo11-product-projection-continuous — ZFC Topo11 Product Projection Continuous","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-topo11-product-projection-continuous","aliases":["58-df-zfc-topo11-product-projection-continuous"],"display":"df-zfc-topo11-product-projection-continuous — ZFC Topo11 Product Projection Continuous","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-zfc-top5-product-topology.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-zfc-top5-continuous-map.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-topo11-product-projection-continuous"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-topo11-product-projection-continuous</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-topo11-product-projection-continuous — ZFC Topo11 Product Projection Continuous"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5260a5349d0b732f\" href=\"?note=5260a5349d0b732f\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-zfc-top5-product-topology.md\">../batch05/58-df-zfc-top5-product-topology.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"682d2801cf83c784\" href=\"?note=682d2801cf83c784\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-zfc-top5-continuous-map.md\">../batch16/58-df-zfc-top5-continuous-map.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I,\\mathbf X,\\boldsymbol\\tau,P,\\tau_\\Pi,i,\\pi_i,x\\in V\">\\(I,\\mathbf X,\\boldsymbol\\tau,P,\\tau_\\Pi,i,\\pi_i,x\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf X(i)=X_i\">\\(\\mathbf X(i)=X_i\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\boldsymbol\\tau(i)=\\tau_i\">\\(\\boldsymbol\\tau(i)=\\tau_i\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ProductTopology}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ProductTopology}_S\\)</span>（乘积拓扑谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5260a5349d0b732f\" href=\"?note=5260a5349d0b732f\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-zfc-top5-product-topology.md\">../batch05/58-df-zfc-top5-product-topology.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span>（函数谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ContinuousMap}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ContinuousMap}_S\\)</span>（连续映射谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"682d2801cf83c784\" href=\"?note=682d2801cf83c784\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-zfc-top5-continuous-map.md\">../batch16/58-df-zfc-top5-continuous-map.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo11ProductProjectionContinuous}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopo11ProductProjectionContinuous}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span>（本原子定义的谓词）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo11\\text{-}product\\text{-}projection\\text{-}continuous}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTopo11ProductProjectionContinuous}_S(\\pi_i,\\mathbf X,\\boldsymbol\\tau,I,i)\\leftrightarrow i\\in I\\land\\exists P,\\tau_\\Pi\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ProductTopology}_S\\bigl(I,\\mathbf X,\\boldsymbol\\tau,P,\\tau_\\Pi\\bigr)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\pi_i,P,\\mathbf X(i))\\land\\forall x\\in P\\;(\\pi_i(x)=x(i))\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ContinuousMap}_S\\bigl(P,\\tau_\\Pi,\\mathbf X(i),\\boldsymbol\\tau(i),\\pi_i\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo11\\text{-}product\\text{-}projection\\text{-}continuous}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTopo11ProductProjectionContinuous}_S(\\pi_i,\\mathbf X,\\boldsymbol\\tau,I,i)\\leftrightarrow i\\in I\\land\\exists P,\\tau_\\Pi\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ProductTopology}_S\\bigl(I,\\mathbf X,\\boldsymbol\\tau,P,\\tau_\\Pi\\bigr)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\pi_i,P,\\mathbf X(i))\\land\\forall x\\in P\\;(\\pi_i(x)=x(i))\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ContinuousMap}_S\\bigl(P,\\tau_\\Pi,\\mathbf X(i),\\boldsymbol\\tau(i),\\pi_i\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>等式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_i(x)=x(i)\">\\(\\pi_i(x)=x(i)\\)</span> 只定义投影函数；连续性必须另外由乘积拓扑与连续映射谓词表达。</li>\n<li>乘积拓扑的有限坐标圆柱基保证每个坐标投影连续。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-zfc-top5-product-topology.md","status":"resolved","id":"5260a5349d0b732f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-zfc-top5-product-topology.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-zfc-top5-continuous-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"682d280